      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Redstone%2C_Montana"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The Poplar Museum and Tribal Museum showcase artifacts and history of the Sioux and Assiniboine peoples of the nearby Fort Peck Indian Reservation.",
